<title>UK: Morgan Stanley adds 120 mln marks to Apr 2012 bond.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley adds 120 mln marks to Apr 2012 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley on November 15, has been increased.  BORROWER   BRAZIL REPACKAGED BONDS LTD</p>
<p> AMT  **220 MLN DEM   COUPON    *13.0 PCT  MATURITY ***15.APR.12</p>
<p> TYPE    STEP-DOWN    ISS PRICE  102.00    PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.50     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*STEPS DOWN TO 10.625 PCT ON 15.OCT.99</p>
<p>		**ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 100 MLN MARKS ON 15.NOV.96</p>
<p>		***CALLABLE AT PAR EVERY COUPON DATE FROM 15.OCT.99</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  2.00	LIST	 0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	THE DEAL WILL AMORTISE IN 17 EQUAL INSTALMENTS OF</p>
<p>		APPROX 5.882 PCT FROM 15.APR.04.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
